			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 750013301,
					"content": "Strange... The golden patterns flew right over, just as before, but the Inscription hasn't appeared beneath this pillar... Why's that?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013302,
					"content": "That indicates that not only has the Inscription been squeezed out, but it's also become fragmented... This is bad. We need to find any scattered bits, and fast.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Titu"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013303,
					"content": "So, where do we find them?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013304,
					"content": "...I don't know either.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Titu"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013305,
					"content": "Huh...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013306,
					"content": "They should still be held down by some power despite being scattered, so my guess is that they're nearby. Maybe we just need to look around...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Titu"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013307,
					"content": "Rawr, rawr!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013308,
					"content": "Hmm? You wanna go over? We're doing something important right now — we'll play with you later, alright?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013309,
					"content": "Mrrraa... Rawr! Rawr!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013310,
					"content": "Do you mean that the Inscription is over there?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013311
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750013311,
					"content": "Rawr!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013312,
					"content": "Oh wow! I've heard that even now, there are still Saurians who can sense an Inscription's power, but I always thought it was hearsay — could it be true?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Titu"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013313,
					"content": "#I suppose you really are no ordinary Tepetlisaurus, {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Titu"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013314,
					"content": "So you can do that too, huh? ...Hmph! You've got some way to go before you can be as good a guide as Paimon.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013315,
					"content": "Hmm?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013316,
						750013318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013316,
					"content": "Paimon's jealous.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013317
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750013317,
					"content": "Says who? Paimon's way more broad-minded than she looks! That was just her way of praising him!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013320,
					"content": "Err... Err?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013321,
					"content": "*sigh* The little guy didn't catch that at all. Bah, if only he was a little smarter...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013322
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013322,
					"content": "I'm sure he'll understand someday...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013323
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750013323,
					"content": "Precisely. Those in the tribe responsible for Saurian care always say that it takes time to truly establish a rapport with them.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013324
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Titu"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013324,
					"content": "The secret to success is as follows — exercise patience, and constantly communicate. Whether humans wish to understand Saurians, or Saurians humans, they both need... lots and lots of time.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013325
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Titu"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013325,
					"content": "#True... Just like Paimon didn't get what {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]} was trying to tell us just now either.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013326
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013326,
					"content": "#Sorry, {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013327
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013327,
					"content": "Rrraa, Rawr!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013328
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013328,
					"content": "You're quick to reply though, Paimon'll give you that!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013329
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013329,
					"content": "Alright, we'll follow you and see if we can find any golden patterns.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013318,
					"content": "See, Paimon's praising you!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013319
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750013319,
					"content": "Well, that's true, but don't let it go to your head now...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		}
	]
}